                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Cave VR is an extremely short plank experience that does little to satisfy any itch.\nThe addition of the log dodging mini-game does very little to redeem what the original lacked.\n\nThere is barely anything offered to warrant a price of any kind. \nAside from the proper use of roomscale the title is short of even being a tech demo.\n\nI received this product for free for the purpose of review and cannot in good conscience recommend it.\n",
